# Desktop UI

Follow root [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) and frontend [`src/AGENTS.md`](../../src/AGENTS.md).

## Hard rules

- Branding: **PC Toolkit Pro** only (`pt-*` components, own logo/accent).
- Vue is presentation; side effects in `lib/services/`; workflow in Pinia stores.
- Semantic CSS tokens only. No random hex in pages.
- Shell: sidebar + page shell + (toolbar → results → action bar).
- Buttons: color/border/shadow only — never translate/scale.
- No raw SVG in templates — icon components only.
- Locales for all user-facing text.
- When layout choices conflict, keep the existing soft shell — do not invent a new product layout.
- Fast/no-hang: hidden window until mount; no startup scans; lazy secondary pages; long work off UI thread with progress + cancel.
